# Dashboard visual language (Overview-first)

Creator Overview is the visual source of truth. Apply the same style across creator (and shared) dashboards:

1. **KPI strips** — use `DashboardKpiStrip` (`@/components/dashboard/DashboardKpiStrip`) with `kpiIconTone` from `@/lib/kpiIconTones` on the **icon tile only**. Card surfaces stay neutral (`bg-card` / clay-card white) — do not tint every KPI card. Brand blues only on icons.
2. **Cards** — `rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]`.
3. **Trends** — pill badges top-right (`trendLabel` / `trendPositive`), not flat text under the value.
4. **Sport / pick rows** — use `sportVisual()` emoji chips and `resultPillTone` for Win / Loss / Pending / Published.
5. **Sample data** — empty accounts get mock preview + amber banner (`?demo=0` / `?demo=1`) per `ui-mock-preview-data` rule.
6. When adding a new stats page, reuse these shared pieces — do not invent a one-off KPI card.

References: `CreatorDashboard`, `CreatorPosts`, `CreatorEarnings`, `CreatorPayouts`, `CreatorLinks`, `CreatorReferrals`, `CreatorSmartPricing`.
